[proof-search readout]
  Treat design-unital as pair-uniform averaging, not as an exact tiler.
  Treat algebraic-unital as mark-preserving: maps must preserve the apex unit/identity.
  Non-unital quotients are exactly the dangerous ones: they forget whether the
  marked spectrum node stayed at 1/14 or migrated to 1/12, 2/27, 3/41, etc.
